ინვესტორს." The introduction guard read the whole message, refused the
question to Gela three times, and it went out as a broken introduction
request. askIsTheIntroduction judges the recipient's own part: a question to
someone the owner named only outside every introduction sentence goes as a
question; when that cannot be told (no name, named in both, not named), the
owner's introduction stands as before. Checked against 0190's wider wording
list: the two compose. No new text.

